---
manual: element.progress
lines: [2060, 2062]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  stack margin: 0.1 do
    title "Progress example"
    @p = progress width: 1.0

    animate do |i|
      @p.fraction = (i % 100) / 100.0
    end
  end
end
----------- test code
bar = progress("@p")

assert_instance_of Shoes::Progress, bar.obj, "progress returns a Shoes::Progress"
assert_equal 1, progresses.size, "one progress bar in the window"
